OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 15 Oct to Sat 24 Oct
OL,6,FThe weather is expected to remain
OL,7,Fchangeable. Low pressure systems will
OL,8,Fcontinue to run across the North
OL,9,FAtlantic, often to the north and
OL,10,Fnorthwest of the UK, bringing
OL,11,Foccasional bands of rain and strong
OL,12,Fwinds, interspersed with brighter and
OL,13,Fmore showery conditions. Rain will be
OL,14,Fmost prevalent across hills in the
OL,15,Fwest and northwest, where above
OL,16,Faverage rainfall is likely through
OL,17,Fthis period. Longer drier interludes
OL,18,Fare more favoured in southern and
OL,19,Feastern parts, but even here there
OL,20,Fwill probably be more rain over the
OL,21,Fperiod compared to recent weeks.
OL,22,FWhilst brief cooler interludes and
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fearly morning frosts are possible,
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Ftemperatures are likely to be a little
OL,25,Fabove normal in many areas for the
OL,26,Fperiod as a whole, and potentially
